{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is a free prologue for the game <i>Exitless!</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Exitless: Prologue</strong></i> is a short standalone introduction to the world of <i>Exitless</i>. In this 10\u201315 minute experience, you play as the person who first discovers the mysterious book that pulls readers into a strange and unsettling dream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a surreal dream world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the maze exit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve light puzzles to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the unsettling creature that roams the nightmare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover how the cursed book finds its way into the hands of the main game\u2019s protagonist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to escape the dream!?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771800?t=1753348215","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771800?t=1753348215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771800/6ea0d61814e744320b678c1f1354b684d079db79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753348215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771800/6ea0d61814e744320b678c1f1354b684d079db79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753348215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is a free prologue for the game <i>Exitless!</i></strong><i>\u00a0